Upstream-Name: motanka-apps
Upstream-Contact: Ruslan Babych <1285978+digitwolf@users.noreply.github.com>
Source: https://github.com/digitwolf/motanka
Comment: The source package bundles the upstream component listed in
 stack/apps-components.tsv as the dpkg-source component herdr/: the
 x86_64 release binary of herdr 0.9.5, from
 https://github.com/herdrdev/herdr/releases/tag/v0.9.5, unchanged and
 SHA-256 pinned. stack/fetch-sources packs the file into the component's
 tarball; the binary package installs it as /opt/motanka/bin/herdr.

